      not: ['share', 'percent', 'percentage', 'fraction', 'much'],
      a: "A scraper streams the WARC records of the crawls (they keep the full HTML) and looks for audio elements and direct links to audio files. It stores the page URL, the audio URL and up to five sentences before and after each link, and prefers WAV, FLAC and AIFF when a player offers several formats.",
