      a: "316 academic datasets, each tied to a paper, preprint, challenge or other academic release; many bring their own descriptions, some written by people. They were found on Hugging Face, Zenodo and in the literature, because tested academic data is cleaner than raw web audio. Appendix H lists every source.",
