      not: ['thesis'],
      a: "A source counts as academic when a citable publication was found for it: an arXiv preprint, a DOI that resolves to a paper, or a citation on its page. Without one it is an internet dataset, typically a Hugging Face upload without a paper. A paper that only uses the data does not count.",
