      a: "Six: Clotho, MACS and UrbanSound8K text-to-audio retrieval, BirdCLEF classification, VehicleSound clustering and FSDKaggle2019 multi-label tagging. M scores 71.1% on FSDKaggle2019 and 31.6% on Clotho, but under 1% on UrbanSound8K retrieval.",
