      a: "XXS 79.1, XS 80.6, S 81.8, M 81.4 and L 81.9. Even XS is level with M2D-CLAP (80.6), just below jina-embeddings-v5-omni-nano (80.7); the best other audio–text model is e5-omni-7B (81.2).",
