      a: "Each clip goes into the bucket of nearest length to reduce padding and speed up training. A GPU batch holds clips of one bucket under a budget of <b>49,152 audio tokens</b>: 136 clips of 6.88 s or 32 clips of 30 s, rounded down to be divisible by eight.",
