      a: "The 95% percentile bootstrap intervals come from <b>20,000</b> resamples over clips: annotator–annotator τ<sub>b</sub> +0.295 [+0.202, +0.387], judge vs. one annotator +0.345 [+0.250, +0.436] and vs. the other +0.265 [+0.166, +0.362].",
