      a: "The cooldown is the last 20% of each budget. Short run: <b>224</b> (1M), 448 (2M), 896 (4M), 1,792 (8M), 3,584 (16M), 7,168 (32M) steps. Long run: 1,744 (32M), 3,488 (64M), 6,976 (128M), 13,952 (256M), 27,904 (512M) and 55,808 (1,024M) steps.",
